        "id": "passive",
        "name": "Golden Frostbound Oath · passive",
        "source": "Weapon",
        "category": "weapon",
        "defaultEnabled": true,
        "description": "Increase DEF by 16%/20%/24%/28%/32%. When the equipping character's Elemental Skill or Lunar-Crystallize attacks hit opponents, gain the Frost Fae's Favor effect for 6s: Geo DMG inflicted by the equipping character increases by 40%/50%/60%/70%/80%, Lunar-Crystallize Reaction DMG increases by 40%/50%/60%/70%/80%. While this effect is active, if there are Moondrifts near the equipping character, all other nearby party members will gain the Frost Fae's Mischief effect: Geo DMG dealt increases by 20%/25%/30%/35%/40% and Lunar-Crystallize Reaction DMG increases by 20%/25%/30%/35%/40%. This effect can be triggered even when the equipping character is off-field. Combat snapshot: set the controls for this hit; durations, stack consumption, healing, energy and cooldowns are not simulated.",
